\pard\b\fs20 Quadromago\b0\par
\fs16\par
The sky islands of Quadromago are the Council's training ground for future mages. Here each team always fields four mages, who enter the arena one after the other, one for each element. The air magus gets to start, and the one with the water staff comes last.\par
